{"abstract":"Det bliver særdeles vanskeligt at leve op til de politiske ambitioner bag kandidatreformen om, at 20 procent af de studerende skal være erhvervskandidater. Uden justeringer bliver resultatet med stor sandsynlighed langt flere korte, etårige kandidatuddannelser, skriver rektorerne fra de otte danske universiteter.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Wegener, Henrik","Bech Nielsen, Brian","Bjarklev, Anders","Ringsmose, Jens","Johansen, Per Michael","Møllgaard, Peter","Leth Andersen, Hanne","Brockhoff, Per Bruun"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-774342"],"filters":{"added":"2025-01","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"de politiske ambitioner bag kandidatreformen er ikke realistiske under de givne rammer","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"doi","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"https://www.altinget.dk/forskning/artikel/danske-universiteter-de-politiske-ambitioner-bag-kandidatreformen-er-ikke-realistiske-under-de-givne-rammer","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-774342","ids":["cbs-4e6fa172-6562-42a4-b30a-39fa73973568"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-5D5FD8D8EF2B2D946E599CEFE33B473A"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"https://www.altinget.dk/forskning/artikel/danske-universiteter-de-politiske-ambitioner-bag-kandidatreformen-er-ikke-realistiske-under-de-givne-rammer","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l