ambitioner bag kandidatreformen er ikke realistiske under de givne rammer","type":"Other-Internet Publication","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-774342","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"Kandidatreformen er et enormt eksperiment med vores fælles fremtid uden nogen som helst garanti for et positivt resultat. Her er vores bud på en reform, der giver et arbejdsudbud og provenu helt på niveau med det, som regeringen ønsker sig, skriver en række rektorer på vegne af Danske Universiteter.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Nielsen, Brian Bech","Malchow-Møller, Nikolaj","Wegener, Henrik C.","Ringsmose, Jens","Andersen, Hanne Leth","Johansen, Per Michael","Bjarklev, Anders","Bruun Brockhoff, Per"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-722691"],"filters":{"added":"2024-03","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-CBS","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-CBS","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"danske universiteter foreslår reform af kandidater regeringen gambler med fremtiden","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dna","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.altinget.dk/forskning/artikel/danske-universiteter-foreslaar-reform-af-kandidater-regeringen-gambler-med-fremtiden","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-722691","ids":["ruc-16aaa59d-9c3e-4992-88fa-f0f4651d8bad"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-F27338E75F39D5CAF31C61BF0396F9E8"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS"