{"abstract":"Danske Universiteter har siden offentliggørelsen af regeringens nye kandidatreform været særdeles skeptisk over for projektet. I dette indlæg forklarer de hvorfor, og kommer med forslag til, hvordan de mener, en ansvarlig og realistisk kandidatreform skal se ud.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Nielsen, Brian Bech","Malchow-Møller, Nikolaj","Wegener, Henrik C.","Ringsmose, Jens","Andersen, Hanne Leth","Johansen, Per Michael","Bjarklev, Anders","Bruun Brockhoff, Per"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-722746"],"filters":{"added":"2024-03","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-CBS","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-CBS","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"danske universiteter sådan skal en ansvarlig kandidatreform se ud","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dna","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://sciencereport.dk/debat/danske-universiteter-saadan-skal-en-ansvarlig-kandidatreform-se-ud/","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-722746","ids":["ruc-6039fa7b-d5dd-4da9-9ce1-936fa6a29248"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-661843BA1F54CEE8C2DF4739B306C0C3"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":[